<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016495850" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016487FA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164879C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001648C9F0" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016487E70" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016493140"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164A9EA0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016487AF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001648B710" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016495FE0"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016954280"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016954610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016954E60" style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The more you book, the more points your business earns</font><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016957B90" style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016958770" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000169589D0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000169590B0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000169597D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001695A3B0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001695D600"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001695E440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBES287.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164733B0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/hero-images/lnd-qbr-back-to-business-campaign.gif" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164776D0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016478170"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016479590"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647ADE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647BED0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647C130"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647C390"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647C5F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647CE20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647D1C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647D420" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register now to fly away with bonus points for your business</font></h3><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016492900">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001648E9B0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164B0C20">For a limited time only, we're offering you the chance to earn 1,000 bonus Qantas Points for your business on every eligible flight booking^, on top of the points your business<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017E8EB40" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 10px;">+</sup>&nbsp;and the traveller<sup data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164B1B90" style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 10px;">#</sup>&nbsp;already earn. Whether you're looking to reconnect with customers or team members, inter-state or overseas,&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647DA10">there's no limit to the number of bookings you can make, meaning there's no limit to the amount of bonus points you can unlock for your business</strong>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016473C00"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164754B0">Simply click the link below to register and make an eligible flight booking by 19&nbsp;February 2023, for travel until 31&nbsp;May 2023. Plus, take up this offer and you'll also be entered into the draw for a chance to be one of 20&nbsp;lucky businesses to win a million Qantas Points.~<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647A170"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647E5F0">It's time to unlock more rewards and let your business fly.<br><br><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647EB70"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647F2B0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001647F770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBES297/thank-you-B2Bflightoffer.html?alt_cam=au:ff:int:edm:sf:qbr-backtobus:salesforce:n:n:n&amp;utm_source=Salesforce&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=qbr-backtobus&amp;utm_content=salesforce"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164800E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016480470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016480B90"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016481010" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164CF7D0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164CFA30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164CFC90" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164CFEF0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D0150"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D03B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D0610" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D0870"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D0AD0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D0E70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D1330"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D1590" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D17F0" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D1D70"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D1FD0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D2230" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D2490" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/facebook.png" title="Facebook" width="40" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D25C0"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/Qantas" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D26D0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/twitter.png" title="Twitter" width="43" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D2800"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D2910" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/instagram.png" title="Instagram" width="51" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000164D2A40"></a><a href="https://www.youtube.